16
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.630
My significant other who's absent, he paints.

17
00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.920
And sometimes he asks me if,

18
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.060
you know, his paintings are to my liking

19
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.840
