21
00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.640
Sometimes I think they could be a little better.

22
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.310
But my question overall is,

23
00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.920
is it ever a good idea to lie?

24
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.250
You know, to keep from hurting someone's feelings.

25
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.560
