57
00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.423
And then when you do love something,

58
00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.302
it's just such a win.
Right.

59
00:02:05.302 --> 00:02:08.200
And so exciting, you know?

60
00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.260
Believe me, I have kids and they show me all their art

61
00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.870
