65
00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.430
Right.
I'm not harsh or critical,

66
00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.590
but you know.

67
00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:25.200
I think just gentleness and honesty

68
00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.260
